  "body": "Set in a quiet cul-de-sac with beautiful sea views, this standalone home offers the perfect mix of quality, privacy and location. With lovely sea views, premium finishes and a great family-friendly location, this is one you’ll want to see.\r\n\r\nWhat you’ll love:\r\n\r\n* Zucchetti tapware & Elementi Robertson bath ware\r\n* Bosch Series 4 appliances, including built-in microwave & fridge/freezer\r\n* Master waste disposal system\r\n*  Engineered timber flooring downstairs\r\n*  Midland Euro brick & BGC weatherboard exterior\r\n*  Colorsteel Longrun roofing\r\n*  50oz quality carpet\r\n*  IKEA wardrobes\r\n*  Stanford 10-Year Warranty + 1-Year Maintenance Warranty\r\n* Glendowie School and Glendowie College\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned in the sought-after Glendowie suburb. A premium home in a premium setting. Contact us today for a viewing.",
